{"title":"Contact and collaboration","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Contact and collaboration","subtitle":"For researchers, institutions and organisations interested in collaborating with THEILUMINA","toc":false},"headingText":"Send us a message","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\nWe welcome contact from external researchers and organisations, in particular in the **transfer areas** of the project:\n\n::: {.transfer-grid}\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Water</b><br>Water economics, governance and policy; access to water and sanitation; water consumption, reuse and the circular water economy</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Tourism</b><br>Tourism economics, competitiveness and sustainability; seasonality; tourism and regional development; spatial and spatio-temporal analysis</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Firms</b><br>Servitization, digital transformation and AI adoption; innovation; international business, alliances and acquisitions</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Poverty and inequality measurement</b><br>Inequality and poverty indicators; well-being and quality of life; decomposition of inequality by groups, regions and countries</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Methods and software</b><br>Bias correction, jackknife inference, computational efficiency and the R package <i>theil</i></div>\n:::\n\n\nThe form opens your email application with the message ready to send. No data are stored on this website.\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- To change the contact address, edit CONTACT_EMAIL below (one line). -->\n<form id=\"contact-form\" class=\"contact-form\" onsubmit=\"return theiluminaContact(event)\">\n  <div class=\"row g-3\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-name\">Name</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-name\" required></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-inst\">Institution</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-inst\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-area\">Area of interest</label>\n      <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"cf-area\">\n        <option>Methods (bias, inference, computational efficiency)</option>\n        <option>R package theil</option>\n        <option>Water</option>\n        <option>Tourism</option>\n        <option>Firms: servitization, digital transformation and AI</option>\n        <option>Poverty and inequality measurement</option>\n        <option>Data sharing</option>\n        <option>Seminars, visits and research stays</option>\n        <option>Other</option>\n      </select></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-type\">Type of collaboration</label>\n      <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"cf-type\">\n        <option>Joint research or co-authorship</option>\n        <option>Applying the methods to my data</option>\n        <option>Seminar or conference invitation</option>\n        <option>Research stay</option>\n        <option>Information about the project</option>\n      </select></div>\n    <div class=\"col-12\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-msg\">Message</label>\n      <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-msg\" rows=\"5\" required></textarea></div>\n    <div class=\"col-12\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Prepare email</button></div>\n  </div>\n</form>\n<script>\nconst CONTACT_EMAIL = \"jfmunoz@ugr.es\";\nfunction theiluminaContact(e) {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const v = id => document.getElementById(id).value.trim();\n  const subject = `[THEILUMINA] Collaboration: ${v(\"cf-area\")}`;\n  const body = `Name: ${v(\"cf-name\")}\\nInstitution: ${v(\"cf-inst\")}\\nArea of interest: ${v(\"cf-area\")}\\nType of collaboration: ${v(\"cf-type\")}\\n\\n${v(\"cf-msg\")}`;\n  window.location.href = `mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;\n  return false;\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n## Where to find us\n\n```{=html}\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\" crossorigin=\"\"></script>\n<div class=\"row g-3 align-items-start\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-7\"><div id=\"contact-map\" class=\"map-box map-box-small\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Map of the Faculty of Economics and Business, University of Granada\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-5\">\n    <p><b>Facultad de Ciencias Económicas y Empresariales</b><br>Universidad de Granada<br>Campus Universitario de Cartuja, s/n<br>18071 Granada, Spain</p>\n    <p>Department of Quantitative Methods for Economics and Business</p>\n    <p><a href=\"mailto:jfmunoz@ugr.es\">jfmunoz@ugr.es</a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=37.1938&amp;mlon=-3.5985#map=17/37.1938/-3.5985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open in OpenStreetMap ↗</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  function draw() {\n    if (typeof L === \"undefined\") { setTimeout(draw, 200); return; }\n    const p = [37.1938, -3.5985];\n    const map = L.map(\"contact-map\", {scrollWheelZoom: false}).setView(p, 16);\n    L.tileLayer(\"https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\", {\n      maxZoom: 19, attribution: '&copy; <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors'\n    }).addTo(map);\n    L.circleMarker(p, {radius: 11, color: \"#fff\", weight: 2, fillColor: \"#E07B20\", fillOpacity: 0.95}).addTo(map)\n      .bindPopup(\"<b>Facultad de Ciencias Económicas y Empresariales</b><br>Universidad de Granada<br>Campus de Cartuja, 18071 Granada\").openPopup();\n  }\n  draw();\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n## Other ways to get in touch\n\n- **Email:** [jfmunoz@ugr.es](mailto:jfmunoz@ugr.es)\n- **Principal investigators:** [Juan Francisco Muñoz Rosas](https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=gedX7Z8AAAAJ&hl=es&oi=ao) and [Encarnación Álvarez Verdejo](https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=dBLU8iAAAAAJ&hl=es&oi=ao), Department of Quantitative Methods for Economics and Business, Faculty of Economics and Business, University of Granada (Spain).\n- **Code and data:** suggestions and issues can be posted in the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/jfmunozrosas/theilumina/issues).\n- **Project identity:** logos for your presentations and publications are available on the [identity page](identity.qmd).\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\nWe welcome contact from external researchers and organisations, in particular in the **transfer areas** of the project:\n\n::: {.transfer-grid}\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Water</b><br>Water economics, governance and policy; access to water and sanitation; water consumption, reuse and the circular water economy</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Tourism</b><br>Tourism economics, competitiveness and sustainability; seasonality; tourism and regional development; spatial and spatio-temporal analysis</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Firms</b><br>Servitization, digital transformation and AI adoption; innovation; international business, alliances and acquisitions</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Poverty and inequality measurement</b><br>Inequality and poverty indicators; well-being and quality of life; decomposition of inequality by groups, regions and countries</div>\n<div class=\"transfer-item\"><b>Methods and software</b><br>Bias correction, jackknife inference, computational efficiency and the R package <i>theil</i></div>\n:::\n\n## Send us a message\n\nThe form opens your email application with the message ready to send. No data are stored on this website.\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- To change the contact address, edit CONTACT_EMAIL below (one line). -->\n<form id=\"contact-form\" class=\"contact-form\" onsubmit=\"return theiluminaContact(event)\">\n  <div class=\"row g-3\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-name\">Name</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-name\" required></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-inst\">Institution</label>\n      <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-inst\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-area\">Area of interest</label>\n      <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"cf-area\">\n        <option>Methods (bias, inference, computational efficiency)</option>\n        <option>R package theil</option>\n        <option>Water</option>\n        <option>Tourism</option>\n        <option>Firms: servitization, digital transformation and AI</option>\n        <option>Poverty and inequality measurement</option>\n        <option>Data sharing</option>\n        <option>Seminars, visits and research stays</option>\n        <option>Other</option>\n      </select></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-type\">Type of collaboration</label>\n      <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"cf-type\">\n        <option>Joint research or co-authorship</option>\n        <option>Applying the methods to my data</option>\n        <option>Seminar or conference invitation</option>\n        <option>Research stay</option>\n        <option>Information about the project</option>\n      </select></div>\n    <div class=\"col-12\"><label class=\"form-label\" for=\"cf-msg\">Message</label>\n      <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"cf-msg\" rows=\"5\" required></textarea></div>\n    <div class=\"col-12\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Prepare email</button></div>\n  </div>\n</form>\n<script>\nconst CONTACT_EMAIL = \"jfmunoz@ugr.es\";\nfunction theiluminaContact(e) {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const v = id => document.getElementById(id).value.trim();\n  const subject = `[THEILUMINA] Collaboration: ${v(\"cf-area\")}`;\n  const body = `Name: ${v(\"cf-name\")}\\nInstitution: ${v(\"cf-inst\")}\\nArea of interest: ${v(\"cf-area\")}\\nType of collaboration: ${v(\"cf-type\")}\\n\\n${v(\"cf-msg\")}`;\n  window.location.href = `mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;\n  return false;\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n## Where to find us\n\n```{=html}\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" crossorigin=\"\">\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\" crossorigin=\"\"></script>\n<div class=\"row g-3 align-items-start\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-7\"><div id=\"contact-map\" class=\"map-box map-box-small\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Map of the Faculty of Economics and Business, University of Granada\"></div></div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-5\">\n    <p><b>Facultad de Ciencias Económicas y Empresariales</b><br>Universidad de Granada<br>Campus Universitario de Cartuja, s/n<br>18071 Granada, Spain</p>\n    <p>Department of Quantitative Methods for Economics and Business</p>\n    <p><a href=\"mailto:jfmunoz@ugr.es\">jfmunoz@ugr.es</a></p>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=37.1938&amp;mlon=-3.5985#map=17/37.1938/-3.5985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open in OpenStreetMap ↗</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  function draw() {\n    if (typeof L === \"undefined\") { setTimeout(draw, 200); return; }\n    const p = [37.1938, -3.5985];\n    const map = L.map(\"contact-map\", {scrollWheelZoom: false}).setView(p, 16);\n    L.tileLayer(\"https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png\", {\n      maxZoom: 19, attribution: '&copy; <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors'\n    }).addTo(map);\n    L.circleMarker(p, {radius: 11, color: \"#fff\", weight: 2, fillColor: \"#E07B20\", fillOpacity: 0.95}).addTo(map)\n      .bindPopup(\"<b>Facultad de Ciencias Económicas y Empresariales</b><br>Universidad de Granada<br>Campus de Cartuja, 18071 Granada\").openPopup();\n  }\n  draw();\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n## Other ways to get in touch\n\n- **Email:** [jfmunoz@ugr.es](mailto:jfmunoz@ugr.es)\n- **Principal investigators:** [Juan Francisco Muñoz Rosas](https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=gedX7Z8AAAAJ&hl=es&oi=ao) and [Encarnación Álvarez Verdejo](https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=dBLU8iAAAAAJ&hl=es&oi=ao), Department of Quantitative Methods for Economics and Business, Faculty of Economics and Business, University of Granada (Spain).\n- **Code and data:** suggestions and issues can be posted in the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/jfmunozrosas/theilumina/issues).\n- **Project identity:** logos for your presentations and publications are available on the [identity page](identity.qmd).\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":true,"code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":true,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","toc":false,"toc-depth":2,"html-math-method":"katex","output-file":"contact.htm